OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAsia made a big AI bet on Nvidia. What
OL,4,Ahappens now?
OL,5,
OL,6,FJensen Huang's extraordinary return as
OL,7,FNvidia's boss rocked not only its
OL,8,Fshares in New York but also sent
OL,9,Fshockwaves through the artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence (AI) industry around the
OL,11,Fworld.
OL,13,FThose jolts were felt particularly in
OL,14,FAsia as the saga highlighted the
OL,15,Fregion's huge exposure to the
OL,16,Ftechnology.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795850301
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AAsia made a big AI bet on Nvidia. What
OL,4,Ahappens now?
OL,5,
OL,6,FTech-heavy stock indexes in Japan,
OL,7,FSouth Korea and Taiwan went on a
OL,8,Frollercoaster ride this week. Markets
OL,9,Fsoared after a near-trillion dollar
OL,10,Fsurge in Nvidia's share price but then
OL,11,Fslumped as concerns about political and
OL,12,Fregulatory scrutiny hit investor
OL,13,Fconfidence.
OL,15,FThe chipmaker is a "symbolic
OL,16,Fbellwether" of the AI trade that is
OL,17,Ffast becoming key to places like South
OL,18,FKorea, Taiwan, Singapore and Malaysia,"
OL,19,Fsays Dylan Loh, an international
OL,20,Fstudies lecturer at Nanyang
OL,21,FTechnological University.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
